{"1494420":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Silica","steam_appid":1494420,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silica is a crossover of FPS and RTS, where you take part in epic photorealistic battles either as humans or aliens. Lead as the commander, or join the assault from the ground - the choice is yours! <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/403eb6b866a89622635408573dccf5a8.poster.avif?t=1793718314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/403eb6b866a89622635408573dccf5a8.webm?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/403eb6b866a89622635408573dccf5a8.mp4?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Part in Epic Combined Arms Warfare<\/strong><br>Immerse yourself in epic battles where humans and aliens fight for ultimate domination.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate Land and Sky<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of both land and air vehicles to assert power over the sandy dunes of planet Baltarus<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/59c7a396f1a158250bf6f66fad0f3a4b.poster.avif?t=1793718314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/59c7a396f1a158250bf6f66fad0f3a4b.webm?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/59c7a396f1a158250bf6f66fad0f3a4b.mp4?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead as RTS Commander!<\/strong><br>Take charge as RTS commander over battles of epic scale. Use your tactical prowess to dominate the battlefield, coordinating complex operations from a top-down perspective.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/10fa22ebefeaa2d8b9e2acc356652b63.poster.avif?t=1793718314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/10fa22ebefeaa2d8b9e2acc356652b63.webm?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/10fa22ebefeaa2d8b9e2acc356652b63.mp4?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Realistic Unit Scale<\/strong><br>Witness the impressive scale of units, from small infantry squads to colossal harvesters and massive buildings. Each unit type is meticulously designed to reflect its size, providing an immersive and realistic experience on the battlefield. <br><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Silica is a crossover of FPS and RTS, where you take part in epic photorealistic battles either as humans or aliens. Lead as the commander, or join the assault from the ground - the choice is yours! <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/403eb6b866a89622635408573dccf5a8.poster.avif?t=1793718314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/403eb6b866a89622635408573dccf5a8.webm?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/403eb6b866a89622635408573dccf5a8.mp4?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Part in Epic Combined Arms Warfare<\/strong><br>Immerse yourself in epic battles where humans and aliens fight for ultimate domination.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate Land and Sky<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of both land and air vehicles to assert power over the sandy dunes of planet Baltarus<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/59c7a396f1a158250bf6f66fad0f3a4b.poster.avif?t=1793718314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/59c7a396f1a158250bf6f66fad0f3a4b.webm?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/59c7a396f1a158250bf6f66fad0f3a4b.mp4?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead as RTS Commander!<\/strong><br>Take charge as RTS commander over battles of epic scale. Use your tactical prowess to dominate the battlefield, coordinating complex operations from a top-down perspective.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/10fa22ebefeaa2d8b9e2acc356652b63.poster.avif?t=1793718314\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/10fa22ebefeaa2d8b9e2acc356652b63.webm?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/extras\/10fa22ebefeaa2d8b9e2acc356652b63.mp4?t=1793718314\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience Realistic Unit Scale<\/strong><br>Witness the impressive scale of units, from small infantry squads to colossal harvesters and massive buildings. Each unit type is meticulously designed to reflect its size, providing an immersive and realistic experience on the battlefield. <br><\/p>","short_description":"Silica blends FPS and RTS in epic, photorealistic battles. Choose to fight on the ground or command from above as humans or aliens. Dive into thrilling multiplayer combat or master strategic command. Are you ready to survive and conquer?","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Czech, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/66c5a129ce55ff945cfbbfb375f55182879b4c14\/header_alt_assets_7.jpg?t=1793718314","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/3585d28e67f331f67aa9f91e3dbce38ab4273c72\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_7.jpg?t=1793718314","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/1494420\/3585d28e67f331f67aa9f91e3dbce38ab4273c72\/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_7.jpg?t=1793718314","website":"https:\/\/www.silicagame.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-7400 3GHz or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 970 or AMD Radeon RX 570<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 48 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Hardware requirements are subject to change during Early Access.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 \/ 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1080 or AMD Radeon RX 5700<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 48 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Hardware requirements are subject to change during Early Access.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><